{"status":"recorded-awaiting-edit","voice":"Hallie – Gentle & Expressive","spokenGain":0.9,"thoughtGain":0.8,"quoteCount":67,"parts":[{"part":1,"quoteIds":[1,2,4,5,7,9,12,14,16,18,20,23,26,29,31,33,37,39,40,42,44,48,50,53,55,57,59,62,64,65,67,69,71,73,75,77,79,81,83,94,98,100,103,105,107,109,111,113,115,118,120,121,122,124,125,127,129,130,132,133,135,137,138,139,141,143,145],"quotedLines":["Yeah,","You and me both.","That depends,","Does the room have a bed?","Then yes. Definitely me.","I've lived with worse.","He was being an idiot.","He took my bag.","I took it back.","Shut up.","You're pulling my leg off.","I wasn't scared.","You're stupid.","Can I punch you now?","That's not my age,","I'm ten.","My birthday. My rules.","Good teacher.","Why are you out here?","From what?","There aren't any spiders.","Why would we want them to slam?","I'm already annoyed with you.","Wonderful. Saves me explaining.","Did the van also break your phone?","Finally, a diagnosis.","Did you get extra chips?","Yes.","Because you know how it ends.","At midnight? You don't even take this route.","What's that?","I pay my own rent.","Then why are you paying it?","Cass.","Where did it come from?","What work?","You'd complain about boring work. You complain when your socks are too boring.","I don't need you to buy me a life.","Then tell me what you are doing.","What's funny?","Well, you've heard it. It remains incredibly charming.","Come over Sunday. I'll cook.","A drunk one?","Where did you even find this?","You have mysterious debts, probably.","You okay?","That sounded rehearsed.","Call me tomorrow,","And don't do anything stupid.","I always do.","Why?","What happened?","Killed?","Where?","Was he alone?","Did he call anyone? Did he say anything?","When can I see him?","He's smiling like that because someone dared him to eat everything,","He was,","About what?","What would you like me to say?","I know what you thought.","Cass, this is disgusting.","Well, Cass,","Whiskey, please.","The one that doesn't ask personal questions.","Then your favorite."],"rawText":"Yeah,\n\nYou and me both.\n\nThat depends,\n\nDoes the room have a bed?\n\nThen yes. Definitely me.\n\nI've lived with worse.\n\nHe was being an idiot.\n\nHe took my bag.\n\nI took it back.\n\nShut up.\n\nYou're pulling my leg off.\n\nI wasn't scared.\n\nYou're stupid.\n\nCan I punch you now?\n\nThat's not my age,\n\nI'm ten.\n\nMy birthday. My rules.\n\nGood teacher.\n\nWhy are you out here?\n\nFrom what?\n\nThere aren't any spiders.\n\nWhy would we want them to slam?\n\nI'm already annoyed with you.\n\nWonderful. Saves me explaining.\n\nDid the van also break your phone?\n\nFinally, a diagnosis.\n\nDid you get extra chips?\n\nYes.\n\nBecause you know how it ends.\n\nAt midnight? You don't even take this route.\n\nWhat's that?\n\nI pay my own rent.\n\nThen why are you paying it?\n\nCass.\n\nWhere did it come from?\n\nWhat work?\n\nYou'd complain about boring work. You complain when your socks are too boring.\n\nI don't need you to buy me a life.\n\nThen tell me what you are doing.\n\nWhat's funny?\n\nWell, you've heard it. It remains incredibly charming.\n\nCome over Sunday. I'll cook.\n\nA drunk one?\n\nWhere did you even find this?\n\nYou have mysterious debts, probably.\n\nYou okay?\n\nThat sounded rehearsed.\n\nCall me tomorrow,\n\nAnd don't do anything stupid.\n\nI always do.\n\nWhy?\n\nWhat happened?\n\nKilled?\n\nWhere?\n\nWas he alone?\n\nDid he call anyone? Did he say anything?\n\nWhen can I see him?\n\nHe's smiling like that because someone dared him to eat everything,\n\nHe was,\n\nAbout what?\n\nWhat would you like me to say?\n\nI know what you thought.\n\nCass, this is disgusting.\n\nWell, Cass,\n\nWhiskey, please.\n\nThe one that doesn't ask personal questions.\n\nThen your favorite.","url":"https://resource2.heygen.ai/text_to_speech/614a49c8312e4000b7232bd515dc476e/8f71d16d1fa84544a4db41a18264d613/id=4456f9ef00cc48e8929946cea82df6e2.wav","duration":99.588820861678,"chars_timing":[[0